            <description><![CDATA[<h2>BlackBar 0.3.3</h2>
<p><strong>Highlights:</strong> Fixes the 0.3.2 launch crash and updates Sparkle to 2.10.0.</p>
<ul>
<li>Fix the launch crash caused by a missing Sparkle runtime search path, and verify embedded frameworks in both architectures before packaging (#13). Thanks @yashiels.</li>
<li>Update Sparkle to 2.10.0 for updater fixes, including macOS 27 delta-update compression handling.</li>
</ul>
<p><a href="https://github.com/steipete/BlackBar/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md">View full changelog</a></p>
]]></description>
